over the asset&rsquo;s remaining useful lives. Long-lived assets are grouped with other assets and liabilities at the lowest level for
which identifiable cash flows are largely independent of the cash flows of other assets and liabilities. As of September 30, 2025 and
2024, no impairment of long-lived assets were recognized.</FONT></P>

